{"parentUuid":"acd2d216-e557-425c-9f3d-7e9cac83446a","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"64d71192-3b1b-4e70-aef9-d69f40568796","agentId":"af55dd10eeeac5fd0","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012iR8sCnhEi7xSCf2fa36Wi","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"SAT Competition 2025 results parallel track winners\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"The Results of SAT Competition 2025\",\"url\":\"https://satcompetition.github.io/2025/satcomp25slides.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"SAT Competition 2025\",\"url\":\"https://satcompetition.github.io/2025/index.html\"},{\"title\":\"KIT - SAtRes - MallobSat scores 1st in SAT Competition\",\"url\":\"https://satres.kikit.kit.edu/news/2025-08-15-satcomp/\"},{\"title\":\"SAT Competition\",\"url\":\"https://satcompetition.github.io/2025/\"},{\"title\":\"SAT Competition 2024\",\"url\":\"https://satcompetition.github.io/2024/\"},{\"title\":\"CanSat Competition\",\"url\":\"https://cansatcompetition.com/winners.html\"},{\"title\":\"SAT Competitions\",\"url\":\"https://satcompetition.github.io/\"},{\"title\":\"19th International Satisﬁability Modulo Theories\",\"url\":\"https://smt-comp.github.io/2024/rules.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Pseudo Boolean Competition 2025\",\"url\":\"http://www.cril.univ-artois.fr/PB25/\"},{\"title\":\"SAT Competition 2022\",\"url\":\"https://satcompetition.github.io/2022/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about the SAT Competition 2025 parallel track winners:\n\nMallobSat won first place in the parallel track of SAT Competition 2025, scoring the best on unsatisfiable instances and second best on satisfiable instances (after Painless-PRS-Kissat), with an overall victory by a small margin of 3% in terms of the PAR-2 evaluation metric.\n\nThe second-place winner was Painless-PRS-Kissat by Saoudi et al.\n\nThe slides of the SAT Competition 2025 results were made available on August 16, 2025, and these slides contain all the rankings and additional details about the 